# Vendored prebuilt dependencies are build inputs and are checked in deliberately, so each ships
# framework is re-included explicitly below. Everything else under Vendor/ stays out of the index.
# An ignored binary that is never added breaks every other checkout, and `git status` hides it.
vendor/*
!Vendor/OpenSSL.xcframework
!Vendor/OpenSSL.xcframework/**
!Vendor/usrsctp.xcframework
!Vendor/usrsctp.xcframework/**
# Vendored source dependency (patched Quiver). Deliberately checked in; see Vendor/Quiver/VENDORING.md.
!Vendor/Quiver
!Vendor/Quiver/**
third_party/sentry-native/
.vscode/settings.json
tools/vendor-js/node_modules/

